---
title: Product Marketing Kit
---

# Product Marketing Kit

Components for the marketing space. Each one is built only from core Noma
blocks and style tokens, so it renders in every target, validates, and stays
safe for agents to fill in. Pages use them as `::pricing_card{...}` and keep
one stable ID per use.

::component{name="pricing_card" props="plan,price,period?,cta?" slots="features" description="A plan in a pricing grid."}
:::card{title="{{plan}}" class="elevated"}
**{{price}}** {{period}}

{{slot:features}}

{{cta}}
:::
::

::component{name="stat" props="value,label" description="A headline number with a caption."}
:::card{class="plain align-center"}
**{{value}}**

{{label}}
:::
::

::component{name="feature" props="title" description="A titled feature panel; the body is the default slot."}
:::card{title="{{title}}" class="tone-info filled"}
{{slot}}
:::
::
